---
import Main from "@/layouts/Main.astro";
import PageHeader from "@/components/PageHeader.astro";
---

<Main
  title="Contact: Register interest in DAI Compute"
  description="Register your interest to invest, build, or partner. DAI Compute is pre-launch and pursuing regulatory clarity; no financial product is offered yet."
  activePath="/contact"
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Contact"
    title="Back Canadian compute. Start the conversation."
    lede="Tell us how you would like to participate: invest for yield, borrow to build, buy sovereign compute, or partner on energy or financing."
  />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr]">
      <div>
        <p class="field-label" style="color: var(--color-orange);">Get in touch</p>
        <h2 class="mt-4 font-display text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-snow sm:text-3xl">
          We read every message.
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate">
          DAI Compute is in its early stages and pursuing regulatory clarity
          through the CSA Sandbox. No financial product is offered yet. If you
          want to be part of the first cohort, or to explore an energy or
          financing partnership, this is the place to start.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 space-y-5">
          <div>
            <p class="field-label text-slate">Email</p>
            <a href="mailto:hello@daicompute.ca" class="accent-link mt-1 inline-block text-lg">hello@daicompute.ca</a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="field-label text-slate">The near-term goal</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate">
              A first cohort of pilot nodes operational within a year. Real
              hardware, real generation, real compute.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-hairline bg-ink-2/50 p-8">
        <p class="field-label" style="color: var(--color-orange);">How to structure your inquiry</p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate">
          There is no form to submit yet. To reach us, email
          <a href="mailto:hello@daicompute.ca" class="accent-link">hello@daicompute.ca</a>
          directly. The fields below are an example of how to structure your
          message so we can route it quickly.
        </p>

        <!-- Illustrative template. Inputs are disabled: this is an example of
             what to include in an email, not a working form. -->
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-5" aria-hidden="true">
          <div>
            <label class="field-note block text-slate/70">Name</label>
            <input type="text" disabled placeholder="Your name" class="mt-1.5 w-full cursor-not-allowed border border-hairline bg-ink/60 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate/50 placeholder:text-slate/40" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="field-note block text-slate/70">Email</label>
            <input type="text" disabled placeholder="you@example.ca" class="mt-1.5 w-full cursor-not-allowed border border-hairline bg-ink/60 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate/50 placeholder:text-slate/40" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="field-note block text-slate/70">I am a</label>
            <input type="text" disabled placeholder="Investor / node operator / energy company / financing partner / enterprise buyer" class="mt-1.5 w-full cursor-not-allowed border border-hairline bg-ink/60 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate/50 placeholder:text-slate/40" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label class="field-note block text-slate/70">Message</label>
            <textarea rows="4" disabled placeholder="How you would like to participate, and any context on your energy, compute, or capital position." class="mt-1.5 w-full cursor-not-allowed border border-hairline bg-ink/60 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-sm text-slate/50 placeholder:text-slate/40"></textarea>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a
          href="mailto:hello@daicompute.ca?subject=DAI%20Compute%20inquiry&body=Name%3A%20%0AEmail%3A%20%0AI%20am%20a%3A%20(investor%20%2F%20node%20operator%20%2F%20energy%20company%20%2F%20financing%20partner%20%2F%20enterprise%20buyer)%0A%0AMessage%3A%20%0A"
          class="btn-primary mt-6 flex w-full items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 text-sm"
        >
          Email hello@daicompute.ca
        </a>
        <p class="field-note mt-3 text-slate/60">
          Opens your email client with these fields as a template.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Main>
